==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Moblin Horns are dropped by [[Moblin]]s and [[Stalmoblin]]s upon defeat. They are useful as [[Ingredient]]s in creating various [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Gray Dye]] as well as sold to [[Kilton]] in exchange for [[Mon]].

The [[Fireproof Armor]] set requires Moblin Horns, in addition to a [[Fireproof Lizard]], to upgrade each piece to its first tier at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
{{Material Armors|BotW|Moblin Horn}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Moblin Horn}}
Moblin Horns return in {{TotK}} and are once again dropped by [[Moblin]]s and [[Stalmoblin]]s upon their defeat. They can be [[Fuse]]d onto [[Weapon]]s to make them more powerful.

